          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghora nani ukighamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Idana oho mwana wa mdamu, woka kulilia Tiro, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kughuzere muzi ghwa Tiro ghuko aho andu kongiria cha baharinyi, aho ghubonyeragha biashara na kwa wandu wengi wa masanga gha pwani kukaia Bwana MLUNGU waghamba huwu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wandu wa Pashia, Lidia na Libya werekoghe andenyi ya ijeshi jako ja wuda, wikawanika ngao na kofia kambinyi kwako; wikawonyera wubaa ghwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Arvadi, na masikari ghako werelindirieghe mawurigha ghako chia rose; na wandu wa Gamadi werelindirieghe minara yako; wadawanika ngao rawo aighu ya mawurigha ghako chia rose, na kukubonya kuwoneke kughokie putu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Korebonyereghe biashara na Spania, angu korekoghe na mali nyingi ra kula kichuku; wikafunya feza, chuma, ibamba, na risasi kuzoghorana na vilambo vako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korebonyereghe biashara na Griki, na Tubali, na Mesheki; wikafunya wandu na vilambo va shaba kuzoghorana na vilambo vako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korezoghoraneghe na Beth-togarma kwa farasi ra kazi, farasi ra wuda, na nyumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Rode,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rode:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "angu Kiebrania Dedani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " werebonyereghe biashara na oho; na masanga gha pwani mengi nigho koreghuaneghe nagho. Werekuredieghe mbembe ra chovu na mwingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siria orebonyereghe biashara na oho, angu korekoghe na vilambo vingi; korezoghoraneghe nawo kwa amrade, zambarau, nguwo ritolelo, kitani ndicha, ngola ra baharinyi, na agate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juda na isanga ja Israeli werebonyereghe biashara na oho; wikazoghorana na oho kwa ngano, na zeituni, na tini, wuki, mavuda, na marumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dameshki orebonyereghe biashara na oho, kwa wundu ghwa wungi ghwa vilambo vako; angu korekoghe na mali nyingi ra kula kilambo; ukazoghorana na oho kwa divei ya Helboni, na pamba ifumie Zahari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wokoni Wedani na Griki wikareda vilambo kufuma Uzali; wikazoghorana na oho kwa chuma chieleshero, na mdalasini, na mirangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dedani orebonyereghe biashara na oho kwa mito eseria ngelo ejoka farasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arabia na wabaa wose wa Kedari werekoghe wakundwa wako kwa wundu ghoghuana wana wa ng'ondi, bauru na mburi, naro niro korebonyereghe biashara nawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa biashara wa Sheba na Raama werebonyereghe biashara na oho; wikazoghorana na oho kwa vilungo vawo viboie va mbari rose, na magho gha zoghori mbaa na dhahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harani, Kane, Edeni, Ashuri na Kimadi werebonyereghe biashara na oho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa wandu werebonyereghe biashara na oho ya nguwo riboie, ra buluu, na iro ritolelo na mazulia gha rangi zima zima ghidungilo na kamba remaziria. Kwa vilambo ivi vose werebonyereghe biashara na oho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meli ra Spania rerekoghe rikidamba rikikudukia vilambo vako va biashara. Kwa huwo korekoghe kwalemerelwa nandighi ghadi na ghadi ya bahari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.11+REV.18.12+REV.18.13+REV.18.14+REV.18.15+REV.18.16+REV.18.17+REV.18.18+REV.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuf. 18.11-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wandu wose wikaiagha masanga gha pwani, waawuyakushinikia; wazuri wawo wachulwa ni wowa, na mawushu ghawo ghakuchika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa biashara aghadi ya mbari ra wandu waawuyakuseka; kutua kwako koobosha, kwameria kukuvikia; hata ndekuchaawoneka kwa kala na kala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
